<title>USA: Mace acquires safety goods marketer MSP.</title>
<headline>Mace acquires safety goods marketer MSP.</headline>
<dateline>BENNINGTON, Vt. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mace Security International Inc said Tuesday it had acquired MSP Inc, a marketer of consumer safety and security products.</p>
<p>Mace, known for its defense sprays, did not disclose the terms of the deal with MSP of Aurora, Colorado.</p>
<p>It said MSP would be run by a former principal stockholder, Howard Edelman, who has worked for sporting goods manufacturer Olson Industries Inc.</p>
